  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth and women in communes of Tagazar, Balleyara, Dargol and Gotheye, in Tillaberi region of Niger will lead initiatives to mitigate climate change effects, awareness campaigns, climate. Community capacity will be strengthened in farming and climate-smart agriculture. School and community gardens will be established to bolster school feeding and promote new agriculture practices. CSOs will champion climate-smart practices within rural communities.</narrative>
  </description>
